  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 28. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 外野 — 野球場で内野の外側に広がる場所。\n2. 外野手 — 野球で外野を守る選手。\n3. 概要 — 全体の大まかな内容。\n4. 外来語 — 外国の言葉から取り入れられた言葉。\n5. 街路樹 — 道路に沿って植えられた木。\n6. 学業 — 学校などで学ぶこと。\n7. 学者 — ある分野の学問を専門に研究する人。\n8. 学習 — 知識や技能を学んで身につけること。\n9. 学生 — 学校で学んでいる人。\n10. 学術 — 学問や研究の体系。\n11. 学童 — 小学校に通う年ごろの子ども。\n12. 学友 — いっしょに学んでいる友達。\n13. 学力 — 学習によって身についた知識や考える力。\n14. 画像 — 写真や絵などを画面や紙に表したもの。\n15. 学科 — 学校で学ぶ分野ごとの区分。\n16. 楽曲 — 演奏したり歌ったりするために作られた音楽作品。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. Mathematical concepts should have neutral concrete examples without unverified numeric diagrams.\n",
